{"title": "Bend Luck (passive feature)", "pageid": 40032, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bend_Luck_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bend_Luck.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Bend_Luck.webp/300px-Bend_Luck.webp, /w/images/c/c7/Bend_Luck.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Bend_Luck.webp/300px-Bend_Luck.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Bend_Luck.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Bend Luck</b> is a passive feature granted to <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(Sorcerer_subclass)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wild Magic (Sorcerer subclass)\">Wild Magic Sorcerers</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When a creature you can see makes an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a>, or a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, you can use your reaction and spend <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/30px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/40px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcery_Point\" title=\"Sorcery Point\">Sorcery Points</a> to roll 1d4, applying the number rolled as a bonus or penalty (your choice) to the creature's roll. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bend_Luck\" title=\"Bend Luck\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp/40px-Bend_Luck_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp/60px-Bend_Luck_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp/80px-Bend_Luck_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bend Luck\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp/40px-Bend_Luck_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Bend_Luck_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bend_Luck\" title=\"Bend Luck\">Bend Luck</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_Sorcerer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wild Magic Sorcerer\">Wild Magic Sorcerer</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715032202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 982/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6211/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2398/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 948902/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.392      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   34.392      1 -total\n 33.55%   11.540      3 Template:Icon_text\n 28.64%    9.849      6 Template:Trim\n 25.30%    8.702      1 Template:Attack_Roll\n 22.33%    7.681      3 Template:Ifempty\n 11.92%    4.101